{"4955450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Effidolum", "steam_appid": 4955450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— It was too precious. So I chose not to see it. —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/2e95418f4475c84dcada53e7cd99d59b.avif?t=1784657514\" width=780 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person &quot;seeing&quot; experience — narrative adventure (ADV)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 3+ hours (no branching choices)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original storytelling system that reinvents the fixed-camera + character-sprite format of conventional ADVs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(1) A first-person immersive camera matched to the protagonist's point of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(2) Lip-sync and blinking synchronized with the voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3) Character motion that creates the feeling of truly being there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(4) Fully voiced from start to finish. Japanese, English, and Simplified Chinese supported. Text and voice languages can be set independently — voices can also be turned off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;It's just a replica — but I loved it more than the real thing.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei Shiotani is a high school boy who loves replica guns more than anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Law-abiding — exemplary — unremarkable —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, a turning point arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You've got a good eye, Rei. No doubt about it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing there was Kotaro — a huge man with an oblivious look on his face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A salesman's smile, and a scout's gaze...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A friend of mine runs a business. Want to try working part-time there?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flattery was excessive, and deep down Rei didn't trust it — but he had no choice but to jump at the offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone had recognized his talent. That alone was enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What lies ahead — a summer vacation of just fifteen days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will Rei see — and what will he choose not to see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei Shiotani</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/4e7141f4b793b0e201bf8f4891090657.poster.avif?t=1784657514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/4e7141f4b793b0e201bf8f4891090657.webm?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/4e7141f4b793b0e201bf8f4891090657.mp4?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Like I keep telling you—the piston cup's shot. Plain old age.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high school boy with a deep love for replica guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has an exceptional eye for things, but the one thing he cannot read is the warmth people give off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satsuki Aihara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/5f27ad5b02a5208eea32d9d35768606c.poster.avif?t=1784657514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/5f27ad5b02a5208eea32d9d35768606c.webm?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/5f27ad5b02a5208eea32d9d35768606c.mp4?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A backwater. That's what I call this place.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman working at the harbor depot, looking somehow worn out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young carer who looks after her divorced mother; attentive and dependable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuzen Momoki</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/9e35b8e3120c1da10773fa2f0baa6554.poster.avif?t=1784657514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/9e35b8e3120c1da10773fa2f0baa6554.webm?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/9e35b8e3120c1da10773fa2f0baa6554.mp4?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I've chased that back all my life. Wanting to catch up to it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man who hired Rei — the one standing at the top of the harbor depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still young, he strives to one day catch up to the father he respects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kotaro Tsurube</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/12ab52c4aa665489c3a5b2d1efb76835.poster.avif?t=1784657514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/12ab52c4aa665489c3a5b2d1efb76835.webm?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/12ab52c4aa665489c3a5b2d1efb76835.mp4?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;No need to freeze up. Believe it or not, we're all about your age.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man who invited Rei to the part-time job at the depot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright and comical — the depot's mood-maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peko Tanaka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/94b3b02df0899a66771163d1f64e2b83.poster.avif?t=1784657514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/94b3b02df0899a66771163d1f64e2b83.webm?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/94b3b02df0899a66771163d1f64e2b83.mp4?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You're all saying complicated things…… What's this about?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The daughter of Koji Tanaka, the depot's investor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haughty, yet somehow impossible to hate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That Guy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/990f7f1930608345a8242eb293fac045.poster.avif?t=1784657514\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/990f7f1930608345a8242eb293fac045.webm?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/990f7f1930608345a8242eb293fac045.mp4?t=1784657514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;......&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >????</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Note</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The setting of this story is entirely original and has no connection to any real events, persons, religions, or organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Endings: 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Controls: Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Save: Autosave supported</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Streaming &amp; Let's Play videos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No prior permission or contact is required to stream this game or to create and upload gameplay videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You are free to create content whether monetized or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Please note</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Refrain from defamatory or aggressive comments toward others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Treat the game's content and other players with respect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Please include a visible link to the Steam page.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >— It was too precious. So I chose not to see it. —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4955450/extras/2e95418f4475c84dcada53e7cd99d59b.avif?t=1784657514\" width=780 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Genre</p><p class=\"bb_p